<tr><td style="padding:32px 32px 8px;">
<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.25;color:#181818;">Your group is booked for Weekend Food Sorting</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;">Hi {{{FlowToolKit__Form_Submission__c.FlowToolKit__Contact1_First_Name__c}}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;">Thank you for bringing a team to the Food Bank. We received your group sign-up and reserved space for everyone below.</p>
<h2 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px;color:#0b5cab;">What we received</h2>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#eef4ff;border-radius:8px;margin:0 0 24px;"><tr><td style="padding:10px 16px;color:#5c5c5c;font-size:14px;width:40%;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;">Group lead</td><td style="padding:10px 16px;color:#181818;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;">{{{FlowToolKit__Form_Submission__c.FlowToolKit__Contact1_First_Name__c}}} {{{FlowToolKit__Form_Submission__c.FlowToolKit__Contact1_Last_Name__c}}}</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:10px 16px;color:#5c5c5c;font-size:14px;width:40%;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;">Lead email</td><td style="padding:10px 16px;color:#181818;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;">{{{FlowToolKit__Form_Submission__c.FlowToolKit__Contact1_Email__c}}}</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:10px 16px;color:#5c5c5c;font-size:14px;width:40%;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;">Company or group</td><td style="padding:10px 16px;color:#181818;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;">{{{FlowToolKit__Form_Submission__c.FlowToolKit__Company__c}}}</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:10px 16px;color:#5c5c5c;font-size:14px;width:40%;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;">Group size</td><td style="padding:10px 16px;color:#181818;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;">{{{FlowToolKit__Form_Submission__c.FlowToolKit__Number_of_Guests__c}}}</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:10px 16px;color:#5c5c5c;font-size:14px;width:40%;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;">Your shift</td><td style="padding:10px 16px;color:#181818;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;">{{{FlowToolKit__Form_Submission__c.FlowToolKit__Start_Date_Time__c}}}</td></tr></table>
<h2 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px;color:#0b5cab;">What happens next</h2>
<ol style="margin:0 0 24px;padding-left:20px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;"><li style="margin:0 0 10px;">Forward this email to your team so everyone has the shift time and address.</li><li style="margin:0 0 10px;">Each volunteer signs a short waiver on arrival; anyone under 16 needs an adult with them.</li><li style="margin:0 0 10px;">Sorting runs about 4 hours. We provide gloves and aprons; please wear closed-toe shoes.</li></ol>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 24px;"><tr><td style="background:#0b5cab;border-radius:8px;">
<a href="https://business-customization-9444.scratch.my.site.com/volunteerslwrvforcesite/" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;color:#ffffff;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;">View your group's shift</a></td></tr></table>
<p style="margin:0 0 32px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;">Questions? Reply to this email or call our group coordinator at (816) 555-0123.</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#f8f8f8;padding:20px 32px;color:#5c5c5c;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;border-top:1px solid #e5e5e5;">
commonUNITE Volunteer Center &middot; 1200 Main Street, Kansas City, MO 64105<br>You're receiving this because you signed up to volunteer with us.</td></tr>
